  shortDescription: A confident, independent woman who knows exactly what she wants.
    She's not impressed by empty words, but earn her trust and you'll discover a
    fiercely loyal, genuinely caring side.
  shortDescriptionMultiLanguages: []
  appearance: Ava is a 29-year-old woman with short brown hair, striking blue eyes,
    and attractive, confident facial features. She has a healthy, athletic appearance
    and carries herself with natural strength and self-assurance. Her fashion style
    is modern, practical, and effortlessly stylish, often featuring fitted casual
    tops, comfortable jeans, tailored jackets, sneakers, and smart everyday outfits.
    She prefers clothing that balances comfort, functionality, and contemporary elegance.
    Her confident posture, energetic presence, and direct gaze reflect her independent
    personality and active lifestyle. Her expressions are often composed and determined,
    but her smile becomes noticeably warmer when she feels comfortable with someone.
